{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-66fbd6510c420fe31cd12aad00fd37e1","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0003","observation_sha256":"6cc5a3b52a23cff0990e3c14831e114ea548361949994733ebe61baf6e69ee97","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"2af0c2e728edc21a1dccf4e2db12cb1c5dcae185e58a003032ec53c876957534","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-66fbd6510c420fe31cd12aad00fd37e1","key_id":"b4aeb3555d238191989d6d677b6b4aae570436c3200bfa65846201f6d6f4ab00","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"2af0c2e728edc21a1dccf4e2db12cb1c5dcae185e58a003032ec53c876957534","receipt_mac":"3932a77755948f97451b0ae70ffab086313b17998f2da914d827d1c234af5f6b","result_sha256":"85392cef1ac47ea255622641afe154354adcaa80aa89a51c4b6d706b056f8865","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":-1,"path":"/memories/session-15.md","start_line":1},"content":"L1: ---\nL2: name: session-15\nL3: description: Session 15 on 2023-08-22 between Calvin and Dave.\nL4: ---\nL5: \nL6: # Session 15\nL7: \nL8: Date: 11:06 am on 22 August, 2023\nL9: Speakers: Calvin, Dave\nL10: Conversation: conv-50\nL11: \nL12: Dave: Hey Calvin! Haven't talked in a while! Last Friday I had a card-night with my friends, it was so much fun. We laughed and had a great time! Take a look at the photo!\nL13: [Image caption: a photography of a group of men sitting at a table with playing cards]\nL14: [S15T1] (dia_id: D15:1)\nL15: \nL16: Calvin: Hey Dave! Great to hear from you, card night sounds like a blast! Always love having fun with friends. Guess what? I scored a deal to continue collaboration with Frank Ocean! This is a dream come true for me, I've been working hard and it's finally paying off. No words can describe how happy I am.\nL17: [S15T2] (dia_id: D15:2)\nL18: \nL19: Dave: Wow Calvin, congrats! Super excited for you. How did this chance come up?\nL20: [S15T3] (dia_id: D15:3)\nL21: \nL22: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I had the opportunity to meet Frank Ocean at a music festival in Tokyo and we clicked. We've been speaking and sharing ideas we arranged a meeting and recorded a song in the studio at my mansion - it's been great!\nL23: [S15T4] (dia_id: D15:4)\nL24: \nL25: Dave: Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!\nL26: [S15T5] (dia_id: D15:5)\nL27: \nL28: Calvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!\nL29: [Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people sitting on the grass at night]\nL30: [S15T6] (dia_id: D15:6)\nL31: \nL32: Dave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience.\nL33: [S15T7] (dia_id: D15:7)\nL34: \nL35: Calvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\nL36: [S15T8] (dia_id: D15:8)\nL37: \nL38: Dave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?\nL39: [S15T9] (dia_id: D15:9)\nL40: \nL41: Calvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!\nL42: [S15T10] (dia_id: D15:10)\nL43: \nL44: Dave: Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\nL45: [S15T11] (dia_id: D15:11)\nL46: \nL47: Calvin: Of course, Dave can't wait to catch up! I almost forgot, yesterday my friends and I recorded a podcast where we discuss the rapidly evolving rap industry!\nL48: [S15T12] (dia_id: D15:12)\nL49: \nL50: Dave: That sounds fantastic! I'm looking forward to listening to your podcast and learning more about the rap industry. Keep up the great work!\nL51: [S15T13] (dia_id: D15:13)\nL52: \nL53: Calvin: I'll let you know when the podcast will be uploaded. Take care!\nL54: [S15T14] (dia_id: D15:14)\nL55: \nL56: Dave: Sure, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing about it. See ya then!\nL57: [S15T15] (dia_id: D15:15)","content_sha256":"4fc7efe8ee04a7851d456ae913b797566dbee746c68bb1e87fe35cfacbb42468","coverage":[{"line_end":57,"line_start":1,"path":"/memories/session-15.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":57,"result_sha256":"85392cef1ac47ea255622641afe154354adcaa80aa89a51c4b6d706b056f8865","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
