{"action_ordinal":4,"episode_id":"r1ep-66fbd6510c420fe31cd12aad00fd37e1","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0004","observation_sha256":"676382a0e88a2153ab6c9e8b3636d32c23727ca0ddd8cb7490891586d311e5aa","ordinal":4,"provider_round":4,"question_sha256":"2af0c2e728edc21a1dccf4e2db12cb1c5dcae185e58a003032ec53c876957534","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":4,"episode_id":"r1ep-66fbd6510c420fe31cd12aad00fd37e1","key_id":"b4aeb3555d238191989d6d677b6b4aae570436c3200bfa65846201f6d6f4ab00","ordinal":4,"provider_round":4,"question_sha256":"2af0c2e728edc21a1dccf4e2db12cb1c5dcae185e58a003032ec53c876957534","receipt_mac":"53de7cb0020bbc2b785b3ed48ef7e2f2dbe12eacab9f2ac25a8d81edd0d2098f","result_sha256":"e99c1f372df0eca79b6a044d9bb0b047804ee6b300c45c95ed7854697654f25c","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":60,"path":"/memories","pattern":"Friday|hosted|friends over|we played|played cards|night with"},"content":"/memories/session-06.md:L34: Dave: I'm so excited, I opened my car shop last week! Invited some friends over to celebrate and it's been amazing. Super stoked to share my passion and help out with folks' rides. It's been incredible so far.\n/memories/session-06.md:L51: [Image caption: a photo of a city at night with a lot of lights]\n/memories/session-08.md:L30: Dave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\n/memories/session-09.md:L12: Calvin: Hi Dave! Nice to hear from you. Since last chat, some things have happened. I had a lil car accident last Friday, kinda upsetting but no one was hurt. I've been dealing with insurance and repairs - taking up a lot of time and energy. Look at this photo!\n/memories/session-15.md:L12: Dave: Hey Calvin! Haven't talked in a while! Last Friday I had a card-night with my friends, it was so much fun. We laughed and had a great time! Take a look at the photo!\n/memories/session-22.md:L12: Dave: Hey Calvin! What’s up? Last Friday I went to the car show. I saw some awesome cars and got to mess with car mods! There were so many cool machines around, it was so much fun! Take a look at this beautiful car!\n/memories/session-24.md:L57: [Image caption: a photo of a crowded street at night with people walking and walking]\n/memories/session-24.md:L67: [Image caption: a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background]","content_sha256":"04a3c6749f696c96af15aa59fb67723d278a374881ccc9a42bce293bb0080202","coverage":[{"line_end":34,"line_start":34,"path":"/memories/session-06.md"},{"line_end":51,"line_start":51,"path":"/memories/session-06.md"},{"line_end":30,"line_start":30,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/session-09.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/session-15.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/session-22.md"},{"line_end":57,"line_start":57,"path":"/memories/session-24.md"},{"line_end":67,"line_start":67,"path":"/memories/session-24.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":8,"result_sha256":"e99c1f372df0eca79b6a044d9bb0b047804ee6b300c45c95ed7854697654f25c","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"grep","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":true},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
